    "user_question": "Evaluate associative cross-modal regulatory concordance across matched ENCODE K562 erythroleukemia and GM12878 B-lymphoblastoid biological replicates (N=6 shared sample IDs, 3 per lineage) profiled independently by bulk polyA+ RNA-seq and bulk ATAC-seq on GRCh38. Run pyDESeq2 differential expression and differential accessibility (K562 versus GM12878), then quantify cis DE x DA directional concordance, TF expression-motif triangulation, shared pathway convergence, and sample-matched cis Spearman correlation without claiming single-cell pairing.",
